  "label": "internet meme culture audience",
  "description": "The target community is individuals familiar with internet meme formats and tropes, particularly those who recognize the common meme structure where someone claims to be doing something simple or 'basic' (like using two fingers) to imply a lack of complexity or effort. This audience understands the visual-textual mapping of the peace sign gesture to the phrase 'now i'm gonna use two fingers' as a humorous or ironic setup, often used for self-deprecating humor.",
